## 6️⃣  Performance & SEO

| Technique | How to implement |
|-----------|------------------|
| **Image optimization** | `next/image` component, `layout="responsive"` |
| **Code splitting** | Dynamic imports (`next/dynamic`) |
| **Lazy load** | IntersectionObserver or `next/dynamic` with `ssr: false` |
| **Preload critical assets** | `<link rel="preload">` in `_document.tsx` |
| **Meta tags** | `next/head` per page, dynamic titles |
| **Sitemap** | `next-sitemap` package |
| **Robots.txt** | `public/robots.txt` |
| **Structured data** | JSON‑LD in `<Head>` |

---

## 7️⃣  Accessibility Checklist

| Check | Tool | How to fix |
|-------|------|------------|
| **Color contrast** | axe, Lighthouse | Adjust Tailwind colors |
| **Keyboard navigation** | Manual test | Ensure focus states, `tabindex` |
| **ARIA labels** | axe | Add `aria-label` to interactive elements |
| **Semantic HTML** | Manual | Use `<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<footer>` |
| **Alt text** | Manual | Provide descriptive `alt` for images |
| **Skip link** | Manual | `<a href="#main" className="skip-link">Skip to content</a>` |

---

## 8️⃣  Testing Strategy

| Layer | Tool | Example |
|-------|------|---------|
| **Unit** | Jest + React Testing Library | Test component rendering |
| **Integration** | Cypress | End‑to‑end checkout flow |
| **Accessibility** | axe | `cy.injectAxe(); cy.checkA11y();` |
| **Performance** | Lighthouse CI | `lighthouse-ci` in CI pipeline |

```bash
npm i --save-dev jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom cypress axe-core
```

